# edge_cases (Ruby)

Ruby bindings for `edge_cases` using the [ffi](https://github.com/ffi/ffi) gem.

## Prerequisites

- Ruby 2.7 or newer
- The native library (`libedge_cases.so`, `libedge_cases.dylib`, or `edge_cases.dll`) on the library
  search path, or its path in the `EDGE_CASES_LIBRARY` environment variable.

## Install

```bash
gem build edge_cases.gemspec
gem install edge_cases-0.1.0.gem
```

## Usage

```ruby
require 'edge_cases'

EdgeCases::ABI_VERSION
```

